{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PRESS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Everyone with a Quest needs to play it&quot; - <i>TechRadar</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;An adorable mini-golf game that is unexpectedly convincing&quot; - <i>New York Times</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Brilliantly designed...seriously, you have no idea how good VR mini-golf is&quot; - <i>CNET</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;A magnificent collection of challenging holes set in fantasy locations&quot; - <i>The Washington Post</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Walkabout Mini Golf</i> takes everything you love about the real-life game and makes it better. Putting is easy and natural, the physics are completely realistic, and a wide variety of courses provide the perfect challenge for hardcore golfers, and casual players alike. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408230/extras/68c211cdbf658636d964ce30a8f038df.poster.avif?t=1769742598\" width=600 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408230/extras/68c211cdbf658636d964ce30a8f038df.webm?t=1769742598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408230/extras/68c211cdbf658636d964ce30a8f038df.mp4?t=1769742598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COURSES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each 18-hole course is carefully crafted to replicate the feeling of classic mini golf in a larger-than-life location. Interconnected holes encourage you to explore the entire course, search for lost balls and invent your own trick shots using anything and everything in the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2800<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408230/extras/7fc9e185b4a65c3b1a7859d0e455fddc.poster.avif?t=1769742598\" width=616 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408230/extras/7fc9e185b4a65c3b1a7859d0e455fddc.webm?t=1769742598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408230/extras/7fc9e185b4a65c3b1a7859d0e455fddc.mp4?t=1769742598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NIGHT MODE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you master a course, you're only halfway there! Night Mode isn't just cosmetic, every hole has been modified, and sometimes completely redesigned to provide an entirely new course. In the redesigned courses, there will be even harder challenges, new collectibles, and a completely different aesthetic than the regular courses. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408230/extras/d9ba8f2c686d0521157ebc904207cf37.poster.avif?t=1769742598\" width=600 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408230/extras/d9ba8f2c686d0521157ebc904207cf37.webm?t=1769742598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408230/extras/d9ba8f2c686d0521157ebc904207cf37.mp4?t=1769742598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MULTIPLAYER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's better with friends! Full crossplay lets up to 8 players join a private room with voice chat no matter what platform they're playing on. Join our Discord for regular tournaments, or host your own by simply entering the same room name as anyone you want to play with!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408230/extras/fb6bec53d280b737f3a439181b7972d9.poster.avif?t=1769742598\" width=600 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408230/extras/fb6bec53d280b737f3a439181b7972d9.webm?t=1769742598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408230/extras/fb6bec53d280b737f3a439181b7972d9.mp4?t=1769742598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >14 unique 18-hole courses to master (plus additional DLC courses available).  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock Hard Mode for more challenging versions of all courses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo, a 1v1 online Quick Match, or create a private room with up to 8 players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guest Pass: allows guests of the player with a paid DLC course to play with their host for free.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extremely accurate physics feels just like the real thing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect over 250 custom balls hidden throughout (plus more in additional DLC courses). </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teleport and Smooth locomotion supported, as well as the ability to fly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UPDATED </strong>with Tourist Trap remaster, driving range, practice green, and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete <strong>FOXHUNTS</strong> to unlock special putters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New avatars featuring lip sync, a quadrillion+ combinations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full crossplay between all platforms</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports English, French, Spanish, German, Japanese, Korean and Chinese.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1408230?t=1769742598","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408230/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769742598","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408230/6e559036ba440ffa50cd5942fad2d57b0a3c841e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769742598","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408230/6e559036ba440ffa50cd5942fad2d57b0a3c841e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769742598","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Join Us On Discord!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408230/extras/f98a2157c215b793b759f43b20789323.avif?t=1769742598\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408230/extras_big/f98a2157c215b793b759f43b20789323.avif?t=1769742598 width=800 height=114 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PRESS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Everyone with a Quest needs to play it&quot; - <i>TechRadar</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;An adorable mini-golf game that is unexpectedly convincing&quot; - <i>New York Times</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Brilliantly designed...seriously, you have no idea how good VR mini-golf is&quot; - <i>CNET</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;A magnificent collection of challenging holes set in fantasy locations&quot; - <i>The Washington Post</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Walkabout Mini Golf</i> takes everything you love about the real-life game and makes it better. Putting is easy and natural, the physics are completely realistic, and a wide variety of courses provide the perfect challenge for hardcore golfers, and casual players alike. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408230/extras/68c211cdbf658636d964ce30a8f038df.poster.avif?t=1769742598\" width=600 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408230/extras/68c211cdbf658636d964ce30a8f038df.webm?t=1769742598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408230/extras/68c211cdbf658636d964ce30a8f038df.mp4?t=1769742598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COURSES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each 18-hole course is carefully crafted to replicate the feeling of classic mini golf in a larger-than-life location. Interconnected holes encourage you to explore the entire course, search for lost balls and invent your own trick shots using anything and everything in the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2800<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408230/extras/7fc9e185b4a65c3b1a7859d0e455fddc.poster.avif?t=1769742598\" width=616 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408230/extras/7fc9e185b4a65c3b1a7859d0e455fddc.webm?t=1769742598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408230/extras/7fc9e185b4a65c3b1a7859d0e455fddc.mp4?t=1769742598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NIGHT MODE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you master a course, you're only halfway there! Night Mode isn't just cosmetic, every hole has been modified, and sometimes completely redesigned to provide an entirely new course. In the redesigned courses, there will be even harder challenges, new collectibles, and a completely different aesthetic than the regular courses. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408230/extras/d9ba8f2c686d0521157ebc904207cf37.poster.avif?t=1769742598\" width=600 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408230/extras/d9ba8f2c686d0521157ebc904207cf37.webm?t=1769742598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408230/extras/d9ba8f2c686d0521157ebc904207cf37.mp4?t=1769742598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MULTIPLAYER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's better with friends! Full crossplay lets up to 8 players join a private room with voice chat no matter what platform they're playing on. Join our Discord for regular tournaments, or host your own by simply entering the same room name as anyone you want to play with!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408230/extras/fb6bec53d280b737f3a439181b7972d9.poster.avif?t=1769742598\" width=600 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408230/extras/fb6bec53d280b737f3a439181b7972d9.webm?t=1769742598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408230/extras/fb6bec53d280b737f3a439181b7972d9.mp4?t=1769742598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >14 unique 18-hole courses to master (plus additional DLC courses available).  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock Hard Mode for more challenging versions of all courses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo, a 1v1 online Quick Match, or create a private room with up to 8 players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guest Pass: allows guests of the player with a paid DLC course to play with their host for free.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extremely accurate physics feels just like the real thing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect over 250 custom balls hidden throughout (plus more in additional DLC courses). </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teleport and Smooth locomotion supported, as well as the ability to fly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UPDATED </strong>with Tourist Trap remaster, driving range, practice green, and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete <strong>FOXHUNTS</strong> to unlock special putters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New avatars featuring lip sync, a quadrillion+ combinations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full crossplay between all platforms</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports English, French, Spanish, German, Japanese, Korean and Chinese.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Mighty Coconut"],"dlc":[4112200,4072970,3974100,3819440,3680590,3526580,3400950,3338120,3300630,3220870,3129060,3041950,2876630,2790080,2726330,2652320,2598430,2434550,2380460,2287580,2208010,2086230,2016530,1791210],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.stea